The functional requirements of Spendemic were derived from the main financial tasks an international student performs during a semester. The system must allow the user to create an account, complete onboarding, record income and expenses, view summaries, configure future costs, receive budget alerts, and generate forecasts. Each feature is connected to another part of the application rather than existing in isolation.

